    "Description": "### Summary\n\n`Request.post()` had no limit on the number of fields in a URL-encoded form body. Inserting a large number of repeated keys into a `MultiDict` took quadratic time on the event loop.\n\n### Impact\n\nAn attacker could block the event loop with a form POST within the default `client_max_size` to any handler that calls `Request.post()`.\n\n---\n\nPatch: https://github.com/aio-libs/aiohttp/commit/615fec3d4f088f30d2ee72cad760152e92aa1c53",
